Package: parseMetab
Version: 1.0.4
Type: Package
Title: Metabolic Activity Inference and Analysis for Omics Data
Description: Comprehensive utilities for inferring and analyzing metabolic activities from 
    proteomics and transcriptomics data. Supports multiple metabolic activity scoring approaches 
    (CellFie and pathway-based GSVA), performs limma-based differential testing on inferred 
    activities, and generates publication-ready visualizations. Enables coexpression network 
    analysis on genes and proteins within metabolic classes. Features include multi-cohort 
    analysis pipelines, flexible experimental designs (including paired studies), KEGG pathway 
    integration, survival analysis capabilities, and a comprehensive suite of plotting functions 
    (dotplots, volcano plots, heatmaps, boxplots, circular barplots, and more) optimized for 
    multi-cohort and cross-cancer studies.
